MiMo V2.6 inference snap

This snap packaging is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE).

This snap bundles the following third-party components:

* MiMo-V2.6-Distill-Qwen-9B model weights (GGUF Q8_0 quantization and vision projector)
  Provided by Xiaomi MiMo under the MIT license (see LICENSE-mimo-v2-6).
  Model card: https://huggingface.co/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Distill-Qwen-9B
  GGUF conversion: https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/MiMo-V2.6-Distill-Qwen-9B-GGUF
  The model is a fine-tune of Qwen3.5-9B by the Qwen team (Alibaba Cloud),
  licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-9B).

* llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), MIT license.
  License texts are installed under usr/share/doc/llama.cpp and usr/share/doc/llama.cpp-cuda.

* inference-snaps-cli (https://github.com/canonical/inference-snaps-cli) and
  inference-snaps-webui (https://github.com/canonical/inference-snaps-webui), by Canonical Ltd.

* NVIDIA CUDA runtime libraries (bundled with the llama.cpp CUDA build) and nvidia-smi,
  subject to the NVIDIA license terms.
